bstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf249720-9178-49dc-9ec7-f9b8819903d9_1402x1156.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T93F!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf249720-9178-49dc-9ec7-f9b8819903d9_1402x1156.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T93F!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf249720-9178-49dc-9ec7-f9b8819903d9_1402x1156.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T93F!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf249720-9178-49dc-9ec7-f9b8819903d9_1402x1156.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/stock-picks-performance\">Stock Picks</a></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you don’t want to read about run-ups after they’ve already happened, <strong>upgrading to</strong> <strong>paid</strong> gets you my stock picks, full portfolio and trade alerts in real time.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p>As I’ve mentioned in previous articles, I’ve been spending more time looking at non-U.S. companies trading via ADRs. This one checks several boxes on my checklist: it stands to benefit from rising energy demand tied to data centers, it’s a Latin American business, and it’s still widely misunderstood by the market.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Trade alert:</h3><ul><li><p>Buy AXIA; 3% of the portfolio</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg\" width=\"745\" height=\"35\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:35,&quot;width&quot;:745,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:7847,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/183915723?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ld0E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc2987bd-6b5e-4245-8e40-acba6b0bbaf8_745x35.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><div><hr></div><ol><li><p><strong>The “post-privatization cash-flow flywheel” is real. </strong><br>AXIA’s shift from regulated pricing toward freer market pricing is translating into materially better economics and cash generation, and the story is now more about execution and capital allocation than politics.</p></li><li><p><strong>Capital returns look unusually attractive.</strong><br>AXIA has signaled a shareholder-return-focused strategy (including actions designed to optimize after-tax distributions ahead of Brazil’s dividend tax changes), and the implied shareholder return profile is exactly the kind of “paid-to-wait” setup I like.</p></li><li><p><strong>You’re not paying a premium for the optimism.</strong><br>Even after the volatility, AXIA still screens like something the market is discounting too hard versus a more “normal” utility/infrastructure valuation framework (again: I’ll quantify this in the deep dive).</p></li><li><p><strong>The market just offered us a 24% discount from recent highs.</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ch1b!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ch1b!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ch1b!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ch1b!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ch1b!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ch1b!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"937\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8d173d08-86a1-4b53-8648-cd5f30b34daf_1598x1028.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:937